From de4564f5435cc11b5ee3e82f4dffb39f1f020407 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ondrej1808 <o.hlav@post.cz>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:59:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Storage Rack/Chest: fix item loss on stacking/breaking,
 top-face access, chest GUI scroll+search

- TEMultiTankBase: resolve the whole stack at once (correct bottom/top for every member),
  merge stray contents into the bottom, redistribute contents on break instead of dumping/voiding,
  client relink after sync
- MultiStackHandler: never expose/mutate internal stack, robust NBT (legacy byte count), extract max 64
- Rack shift-extract with full inventory drops instead of voiding
- Chest container closes when the stack is resized/broken
- getMaster() only accepts masters whose footprint contains the block
- Top face opens/inserts; only the same rack is placed on top (stacking)
- Chest GUI: wheel scroll over slots, search jumps to matching line (Enter = next)
- Analysis: PATCH_STORAGE_RACK.md

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
